WEBVTT

00:05.964 --> 00:08.383
[opening theme music playing]

00:36.870 --> 00:39.205
[epic music playing]

00:51.926 --> 00:55.388
Uh, excuse me, Master.
I'm your pupil, Yeom.

00:55.930 --> 00:58.933
Uh, you have been meditating
for 100 days now.

00:59.017 --> 01:00.310
It is time you go outside.

01:04.272 --> 01:05.231
[Heo Yeom chuckles]

01:06.274 --> 01:07.442
Master.

01:12.697 --> 01:13.948
Master.

01:14.032 --> 01:15.366
[somber music playing]

01:15.450 --> 01:17.077
[Heo Yeom gasps]

01:17.702 --> 01:18.745
Master…

01:19.871 --> 01:20.789
Master.

01:20.872 --> 01:22.415
[Heo Yeom crying]

01:22.957 --> 01:23.875
Master.

01:24.709 --> 01:25.794
Master.

01:26.753 --> 01:28.588
No. Master.

01:28.671 --> 01:30.757
[wailing]

01:34.552 --> 01:37.222
[woman 1] Oh, dear, that poor, poor thing.

01:37.305 --> 01:40.099
Terrible. Oh, poor thing.

01:40.183 --> 01:42.101
[woman 2] He must have frozen to death.

01:42.185 --> 01:46.439
[woman 1] Goodness me, so it seems.
Gosh, I feel so sorry for him.

01:47.023 --> 01:48.691
What's going on here? What is it?

01:48.775 --> 01:50.944
[gasps] The homeless boy is dead.

01:51.027 --> 01:54.489
And he was just a young boy.
I feel so bad for him.

01:54.572 --> 01:56.741
[woman 1] Goodness, that poor thing.

01:56.825 --> 01:58.827
[celestial music playing]

02:18.513 --> 02:21.099
[Heo Yeom] As you have always wished,

02:22.350 --> 02:25.353
I will give you a quiet farewell, Master.

02:32.819 --> 02:34.988
[woman 3] Goodness, I feel so bad for him.

02:35.071 --> 02:37.740
[man] Gosh. He seems to be an orphan.

02:37.824 --> 02:39.325
We should hold a funeral for the boy.

02:39.409 --> 02:40.577
- Oh.
- We must do that.

02:40.660 --> 02:42.912
[woman 2] Shall we cremate him
and sprinkle the ashes

02:42.996 --> 02:43.955
- by the lake?
- Oh, my goodness.

02:44.038 --> 02:45.415
[all scream]

02:45.498 --> 02:46.958
[man gasps, stutters]
The child--

02:47.041 --> 02:48.001
Child, are you all right?

02:49.502 --> 02:51.462
[man gasps]
What's going on?

02:52.589 --> 02:55.091
Where is he going? Where is he going?

03:03.850 --> 03:05.351
Stop that now!

03:13.985 --> 03:15.528
[celestial music playing]

03:16.696 --> 03:17.780
[Heo Yeom] Child.

03:17.864 --> 03:20.199
Was it you who spoke just now?

03:22.327 --> 03:23.453
You foolish boy.

03:24.120 --> 03:26.623
I see that you have already burned
my body.

03:27.206 --> 03:28.249
[Heo Yeom] Hmm?

03:29.167 --> 03:31.169
What are you talking about?

03:33.171 --> 03:37.634
Had I been a little later, you would have
burned my cane too, wouldn't you?

03:37.717 --> 03:40.011
- Oh, you foolish boy.
- [grunts]

03:41.971 --> 03:43.681
- [old Master Lee] You.
- [grunts]

03:43.765 --> 03:44.682
- [old Master Lee] You.
- [grunts]

03:44.766 --> 03:46.434
- [old Master Lee] You. You fool.
- [grunts]

03:47.477 --> 03:49.520
You. You fool.

03:51.231 --> 03:53.650
[celestial music playing]

03:56.444 --> 03:57.946
Is it you, Master?

03:58.029 --> 04:00.490
I shifted my soul from my body

04:00.573 --> 04:02.492
to test if I have reached Hwansu

04:02.575 --> 04:04.827
after my 100 days of meditating.

04:05.411 --> 04:09.207
But I noticed my body was burning,
so I entered this body and ran here.

04:10.291 --> 04:11.501
But I'm too late now.

04:14.045 --> 04:18.508
So then, are you saying
that inside this child's body, it is--

04:18.591 --> 04:20.134
it's really you, Master?

04:20.718 --> 04:21.552
Correct.

04:21.636 --> 04:24.639
It is I, Lee Cheol, your only master.

04:24.722 --> 04:26.057
[gasps]
Oh.

04:26.975 --> 04:28.434
Oh. Master.

04:28.518 --> 04:32.730
- Master. Master.
- [tongue clicking]

04:42.699 --> 04:44.951
I am a soul shifter.

04:46.119 --> 04:48.079
[tense music playing]

04:55.211 --> 04:56.296
[Master Lee] Your Majesty.

04:56.796 --> 05:00.633
Did you not summon me today
to find the soul shifter?

05:01.259 --> 05:02.510
I will do that.

05:03.303 --> 05:06.389
I can recognize any soul shifter.

05:10.226 --> 05:12.562
[tense music rises]

05:32.915 --> 05:35.293
[eerie music playing]

05:40.757 --> 05:42.884
[Yeom-su] Are these the last people
who know your face?

05:47.346 --> 05:48.347
[Seo Yul] It's an umbrella.

05:49.432 --> 05:50.933
You can take this instead.

05:52.602 --> 05:54.687
[gasps]
Yes.

05:54.771 --> 05:58.399
There is no one else in the capital
who knows I am not blind.

05:59.192 --> 06:02.236
We will make people see
this is a simple fight between thugs.

06:10.787 --> 06:12.747
That's why you should have stopped
looking for me.

06:17.418 --> 06:18.586
[man] Huh? So-i.

06:21.839 --> 06:22.924
You're So-i, right?

06:23.508 --> 06:25.051
Mr. Kim from Sari Village.

06:26.344 --> 06:27.553
You have the wrong person.

06:34.936 --> 06:37.980
He barely knows me.
We've only ever met in passing.

06:38.064 --> 06:39.107
That man…

06:39.732 --> 06:41.150
must be dealt with.

06:49.867 --> 06:51.953
[pants]

06:52.829 --> 06:54.872
[So-i] There was no need to kill him too.

06:54.956 --> 06:57.500
We would have never met again
once he returned to Sari Village.

06:57.583 --> 06:58.668
[Yeom-su] But you did meet.

07:00.711 --> 07:01.671
Sari Village?

07:04.340 --> 07:05.883
Is that where you used to live?

07:09.011 --> 07:10.012
[So-i] While hiding.

07:11.180 --> 07:14.308
I lived there for a while to hide
from those thugs that you killed earlier.

07:16.060 --> 07:19.564
Is there anyone else, anyone
from Sari Village who might recognize you?

07:20.690 --> 07:23.818
I kept my distance so that no one
would recognize me too easily.

07:24.944 --> 07:26.487
I was a thief there too, you know.

07:26.571 --> 07:28.239
- What's that?
- [So-i] Money.

07:28.322 --> 07:29.866
It would look suspicious
if a man died at the inn

07:29.949 --> 07:31.492
but still had all his money on him.

07:32.076 --> 07:34.162
- [coins clink]
- You should take it.

07:34.245 --> 07:36.581
[tense music playing]

07:44.130 --> 07:45.548
[sighs]

07:48.926 --> 07:51.387
I did not want to harm anyone
from Sari Village.

08:03.774 --> 08:05.526
[So-i] Mu-deok is in the capital.

08:05.610 --> 08:08.654
If I ever see her again,
will I have to kill her too?

08:11.282 --> 08:13.201
Is Broker Kim from Sari Village here?

08:13.784 --> 08:15.786
Yes, second floor.

08:15.870 --> 08:17.079
[innkeeper] Last room.

08:22.668 --> 08:25.087
[suspenseful music playing]

08:25.171 --> 08:26.214
Hmm?

08:47.235 --> 08:48.319
[chuckles]

08:48.986 --> 08:49.987
[Mu-deok] Young Lady Jin?

08:52.114 --> 08:53.199
[gasps]

08:57.703 --> 09:01.707
Wait. What is it you're doing
in a place like this?

09:01.791 --> 09:04.252
What I'm doing here
is none of your business.

09:04.335 --> 09:05.378
[sucks teeth]

09:05.461 --> 09:07.713
And do you perhaps…

09:09.465 --> 09:10.508
gamble?

09:10.591 --> 09:12.468
You… you think I would gamble?

09:12.552 --> 09:16.097
Why would I?
You think I would enjoy such pastimes?

09:16.180 --> 09:17.723
Oh, of course not. No.

09:18.724 --> 09:19.892
But you know,

09:19.976 --> 09:23.312
if you were good enough to not even have
the slightest change in expression

09:23.396 --> 09:25.523
when you were lying about the jade
being broken,

09:26.148 --> 09:28.192
you would probably be a good gambler.

09:30.194 --> 09:31.195
[sighs]

09:32.530 --> 09:34.240
I'm here for tickets from a scalper.

09:34.323 --> 09:37.326
- Hmm.
- A magic show I must see sold out,

09:37.410 --> 09:38.744
that I came here for tickets.

09:38.828 --> 09:40.788
ADMISSION TICKET
SEOCHUN MAGICIANS

09:41.706 --> 09:44.500
- You got two tickets.
- I'm going with my mother.

09:44.584 --> 09:46.335
I want no misunderstandings,

09:46.419 --> 09:48.796
so do not tell anyone
that you saw me here.

09:48.879 --> 09:50.172
[Mu-deok] That may be difficult.

09:50.256 --> 09:52.800
You know,
I'm not as good of a liar as you.

09:52.883 --> 09:55.678
So I'm not sure if I can tell someone
I didn't see you here.

09:56.762 --> 09:59.640
Still though, I will try my best
for your sake, you know.

10:02.560 --> 10:03.477
[sighs]

10:04.353 --> 10:06.397
[Cho-yeon] Why did I have to run
into her here?

10:07.148 --> 10:08.316
[sighs]

10:11.402 --> 10:12.987
[gasps]
Oh.

10:14.196 --> 10:15.948
[man] Hey. One more bottle.

10:17.491 --> 10:18.784
[Cho-yeon gasps]

10:19.327 --> 10:20.995
Why is the leader of Songrim here?

10:24.165 --> 10:28.294
He's not also here to get tickets
to the magic show, is he?

10:28.836 --> 10:29.879
[sighs]

10:30.421 --> 10:33.257
Then I won't be able to go
with Young Master Park.

10:40.973 --> 10:42.975
[ominous music playing]

11:14.215 --> 11:15.508
You…

11:16.634 --> 11:18.177
You killed this man.

11:20.096 --> 11:21.222
I did not.

11:21.972 --> 11:23.099
Why did you kill him?

11:23.599 --> 11:24.975
It really wasn't me.

11:25.059 --> 11:27.019
He was already dead when I got here.

11:32.024 --> 11:33.442
He was killed not long ago.

11:34.276 --> 11:35.361
[Sang-ho] He died by a single stroke.

11:36.487 --> 11:37.947
This was done by a skilled swordsman.

11:38.614 --> 11:41.075
Yes. I swear it was not me.

11:41.951 --> 11:43.869
I don't even have a sword with me.

11:50.918 --> 11:51.794
[woman screams]

11:53.254 --> 11:55.256
[ominous music continues playing]

12:04.932 --> 12:06.809
It was the same person who did this.

12:08.102 --> 12:09.395
Who are these men?

12:09.478 --> 12:14.442
Oh, uh, th-they were a group of thugs
who recently entered the capital.

12:14.525 --> 12:18.237
Did they come here with Broker Kim
from Sari Village

12:18.320 --> 12:20.573
who stayed in the room down there?

12:20.656 --> 12:21.949
Uh, no.

12:22.032 --> 12:25.619
But I remember, these thugs,
they picked a fight with him

12:25.703 --> 12:26.954
a few days ago.

12:27.037 --> 12:30.291
Oh. They caused a scene
trying to find the whereabouts

12:30.374 --> 12:32.460
of a female swindler from Sari Village.

12:33.043 --> 12:34.879
A swindler from Sari Village?

12:35.588 --> 12:37.173
Could that be Mu-deok, my lord?

12:38.507 --> 12:40.759
Where is she now?

12:45.306 --> 12:47.141
I'm sure she was right behind me.

12:49.685 --> 12:50.978
So she ran away.

12:55.608 --> 12:57.401
[panting]

13:01.614 --> 13:02.823
[Mu-deok] What is going on?

13:03.824 --> 13:05.367
What were all those bodies?

13:06.243 --> 13:07.578
They caused a scene

13:07.661 --> 13:10.831
trying to find the whereabouts
of a female swindler from Sari Village.

13:11.790 --> 13:13.209
[Mu-deok] Could that really be me?

13:14.293 --> 13:17.213
What kind of life has Mu-deok led?

13:17.922 --> 13:19.173
[Mr. Kim] Almost forgot,

13:19.256 --> 13:20.549
did you meet with So-i?

13:20.633 --> 13:22.801
I wonder what mischief she is up to.

13:22.885 --> 13:24.678
Try not to get involved with her.

13:26.847 --> 13:27.890
So-i…

13:29.683 --> 13:31.018
Who is this So-i?

13:34.021 --> 13:36.148
I did not see the girl
who came to find you.

13:36.857 --> 13:39.443
But the guard at the door
got slapped by her during an argument,

13:39.527 --> 13:41.403
so I'm sure he remembers her face.

13:42.863 --> 13:46.033
Excuse me, ma'am, both those guards,
they did not come into work today.

13:46.116 --> 13:48.160
- [Ju-wol] Really? Both of them?
- [man] Yes.

13:48.244 --> 13:50.746
Very strange. That is just not like them.

13:56.544 --> 13:59.672
We are sorry.
We should not have disrespected a mage.

13:59.755 --> 14:02.383
[man 1] But there is no need
to do all of this, is there?

14:02.466 --> 14:05.386
A mage?
You lied and said that you were a mage?

14:06.887 --> 14:08.097
I will be soon.

14:08.681 --> 14:12.685
And a member of a noble mage family
at that, far superior to the likes of you.

14:14.853 --> 14:18.482
How dare you talk down to me, you fraud?

14:18.983 --> 14:20.985
I will keep talking down to you,

14:21.944 --> 14:24.780
and you will respect me. Got that?

14:24.864 --> 14:26.031
[sighs angrily]

14:28.701 --> 14:30.202
[man gasps]

14:31.537 --> 14:32.746
Go after them.

14:33.330 --> 14:34.748
That is your job.

14:41.672 --> 14:45.092
Is there a girl named Mu-deok
from Sari Village at Chwiseonru?

14:45.175 --> 14:48.512
There is, I know her. So then, was she
the person that you were looking for?

14:49.471 --> 14:52.641
I wanted to ask her to do me a favor
and return something.

14:52.725 --> 14:54.310
Mu-deok is not at Chwiseonru now.

14:54.852 --> 14:56.520
She works as a servant
for the Jang family,

14:56.604 --> 14:57.938
of Cheonbugwan's Gwanju, my lady.

14:58.689 --> 15:00.024
Working as a servant?

15:01.358 --> 15:03.319
I suppose she really is able to see.

15:04.194 --> 15:06.280
Uh, I see she must have fooled you
as well, huh?

15:06.363 --> 15:08.032
We brought her here
thinking she was blind,

15:08.115 --> 15:10.492
but we were shocked
when she opened her eyes and ran off.

15:12.119 --> 15:13.996
But she's not a swindler like me.

15:15.247 --> 15:16.624
How is she able to see?

15:19.084 --> 15:20.502
[man breathing shakily]

15:20.586 --> 15:22.254
Please do not kill me. Please.

15:23.172 --> 15:24.173
Sorry.

15:24.965 --> 15:27.176
You recognize my face,
so I cannot let you live.

15:28.385 --> 15:29.595
[crying] No. No…

15:32.306 --> 15:34.600
- [sword rasps]
- [blood squelches]

15:53.744 --> 15:57.373
If she was never really blind,
then she might be able to recognize me.

15:59.667 --> 16:01.502
A servant for the Jang family?

16:03.379 --> 16:04.838
I should pay her a visit.

16:07.508 --> 16:09.301
What do you mean Mu-deok committed murder?

16:09.885 --> 16:13.263
Well, several men died
at the ferry inn a few days ago

16:13.347 --> 16:15.808
and Mu-deok was also there.

16:15.891 --> 16:19.645
But Mu-deok is not strong enough
to kill someone.

16:19.728 --> 16:21.605
And especially not enough
to kill several men.

16:21.689 --> 16:23.899
We know it was done
by a skilled swordsman.

16:24.483 --> 16:25.901
So if it wasn't her,

16:26.485 --> 16:28.612
there must have been a mage
who was able to help her.

16:30.114 --> 16:31.073
You are not…

16:32.032 --> 16:33.951
suspecting Young Master Jang, are you?

16:35.077 --> 16:36.328
I am not.

16:36.412 --> 16:39.873
Currently, Jang Uk is at the royal palace
along with Master Lee.

16:39.957 --> 16:41.083
[maid Kim exhales]

16:41.792 --> 16:42.876
Oh, thank goodness.

16:43.460 --> 16:45.379
But it could not have been
Mu-deok, either.

16:45.963 --> 16:48.215
You know that she has no reason
to harm anyone.

16:48.298 --> 16:49.466
[Jin] Maidservant Kim.

16:49.550 --> 16:52.928
How much do you know about Mu-deok?

16:54.513 --> 16:57.099
Do you know what kind of life she led

16:57.683 --> 17:01.020
before she started working for it?
Do you know anything?

17:03.105 --> 17:03.939
No.

17:04.023 --> 17:04.982
The dead man

17:05.816 --> 17:08.444
was someone I had met
to ask about Mu-deok's past.

17:10.154 --> 17:12.114
And a group of thugs
who seemed to be looking for her,

17:12.990 --> 17:14.616
they were all killed as well.

17:17.494 --> 17:20.247
It was obvious that she was bound
to be suspected,

17:20.330 --> 17:23.292
but she ran away
instead of proving her innocence.

17:23.375 --> 17:24.501
One thing's clear.

17:24.585 --> 17:26.128
Mu-deok is hiding…

17:27.254 --> 17:30.340
something that must not ever be revealed

17:31.300 --> 17:32.718
to anyone around her.

17:34.595 --> 17:35.763
[gasps]

17:42.686 --> 17:45.272
The guards live over there
if you need to speak with them.

17:45.355 --> 17:47.441
But would it not be faster to instead

17:47.524 --> 17:50.444
just draw a sketch of her
and attempt to find her yourself?

17:50.527 --> 17:52.112
I do not know what she looks like.

17:52.196 --> 17:55.032
- I met her when I was blind.
- But you weren't.

17:56.283 --> 18:00.329
One day, you say you are not blind
and the next day you say that you were.

18:00.412 --> 18:01.455
[Ju-wol clicking tongue]

18:01.538 --> 18:04.458
You live quite the complicated life
or so it seems to me.

18:06.752 --> 18:08.921
Anyway, you do not know
what she looks like,

18:09.004 --> 18:10.005
but she does know you?

18:10.964 --> 18:13.175
Then would it be dangerous
to look for her?

18:13.258 --> 18:15.969
What if she's the one who killed
the thugs and the broker?

18:16.053 --> 18:17.554
She might try to harm you as well.

18:18.889 --> 18:21.725
Being suspected by the leader of Songrim
is more dangerous.

18:24.603 --> 18:27.231
It will put you in a tough spot
since you paid the broker who died.

18:27.314 --> 18:28.565
What do you mean?

18:29.566 --> 18:31.735
I have no idea what you're talking about.

18:32.528 --> 18:33.570
That's good.

18:34.446 --> 18:36.740
It is best you pretend
you do not know anything.

18:37.324 --> 18:39.326
- [Ju-wol clears throat]
- [man 1 gasps] S-someone is dead.

18:39.409 --> 18:41.578
- [man 2] Someone is dead.
- [woman] Someone is dead.

18:42.329 --> 18:44.164
- [man 2] Look.
- [woman] Someone is dead?

18:44.248 --> 18:46.500
[tense music playing]

18:46.583 --> 18:48.919
- [woman gasps]
- [man 3] That man is dead.

18:49.002 --> 18:50.337
- [man 4] My goodness.
- [man 3] He is dead.

18:54.383 --> 18:55.509
[gasps]

18:56.009 --> 18:58.011
[Ju-wol gasps, pants]

18:58.887 --> 19:01.014
[Mu-deok]
Guard Lee and Guard Jang are both dead.

19:09.064 --> 19:12.568
What Hwansu entails is truly impressive.

19:13.235 --> 19:17.406
[Sun] I truly believe that soul shifters
were all monsters, but in your case,

19:17.489 --> 19:19.575
it is youth and it is eternal life.

19:21.952 --> 19:23.162
It is no wonder that everyone

19:23.245 --> 19:25.873
wanted the ice stone
that makes it possible.

19:26.623 --> 19:29.418
The fights never-ending
because everyone coveted it,

19:29.501 --> 19:31.295
and that is why it was banned.

19:31.378 --> 19:32.754
So, Master Lee.

19:33.672 --> 19:35.591
Since you can recognize soul shifters,

19:35.674 --> 19:37.092
take a look around.

19:37.634 --> 19:40.512
Are there soul shifters
in this palace with us?

19:43.307 --> 19:45.809
[suspenseful music playing]

19:54.318 --> 19:57.196
Well, I cannot tell
just by simply looking at them.

19:57.279 --> 19:59.448
[Master Lee] Because if they do not show
their blue marks

19:59.531 --> 20:01.450
or run wild and become petrified,

20:01.533 --> 20:03.619
they look just like ordinary humans.

20:04.536 --> 20:07.331
Well, then, how do you recognize them?

20:08.248 --> 20:10.209
The fear of being caught. A horror…

20:12.294 --> 20:14.463
of the possibility of being petrified.

20:18.675 --> 20:20.469
So you must bring that out of them.

20:21.053 --> 20:23.847
So you find them by instilling fear?

20:23.931 --> 20:25.724
I apologize if you're disappointed.

20:26.308 --> 20:27.351
Instead…

20:28.644 --> 20:30.812
I would like to give you a gift,
Your Majesty.

20:30.896 --> 20:32.940
You brought a gift? What have you brought?

20:34.191 --> 20:35.359
It is a dog.

20:36.360 --> 20:37.319
A dog?

20:37.402 --> 20:40.072
He is a gentle dog and very clever.

20:40.155 --> 20:42.366
He should be in front
of the royal palace by now.

20:42.449 --> 20:44.493
Do I have your permission
to bring him inside?

20:44.576 --> 20:46.703
You brought him as a gift, so of course.

20:47.496 --> 20:48.664
Bring him in.

20:49.581 --> 20:50.457
Uh, Uk.

20:51.166 --> 20:52.834
I want you to go bring the dog.

20:54.878 --> 20:58.423
And if you're able to do that,
I shall give you a reward.

21:01.677 --> 21:04.846
[suspenseful music rising]

21:28.620 --> 21:30.831
[Jang Uk] Should I just leave
and run away with Mu-deok?

21:32.666 --> 21:34.710
But if I do that, everyone will find out.

21:35.752 --> 21:39.589
And right now, I'm not strong enough
to protect my master.

21:44.177 --> 21:46.596
I wonder what Master Lee plans to do.

21:46.680 --> 21:47.639
[sighs]

21:50.142 --> 21:52.894
[tense music playing]

22:12.914 --> 22:13.915
[court lady gasps]

22:15.000 --> 22:16.209
Assistant Gwanju.

22:17.252 --> 22:18.628
What is it?

22:21.631 --> 22:24.217
[Jang Uk] Wait, the gift that Master Lee
brought for His Majesty…

22:25.344 --> 22:26.678
The gift is Fluffy?

22:26.762 --> 22:29.890
Master Lee told me that
the dog would follow you back inside.

22:31.058 --> 22:32.267
[man] But still…

22:33.560 --> 22:36.730
[Jang Uk] Is it really that dangerous
to bring this dog into the palace?

22:37.314 --> 22:38.398
But why though?

22:40.025 --> 22:40.984
Gwigu.

22:41.777 --> 22:43.320
He's going to bring Gwigu in here.

22:44.654 --> 22:45.947
Gwigu is a wily beast.

22:46.865 --> 22:49.409
How could he bring Gwigu into the palace?

22:50.494 --> 22:54.206
Master Seo Gyeong, who was my master
from a long, long time ago,

22:54.289 --> 22:57.834
used Gwigu to find evil relics
created with sorcery

22:57.918 --> 22:59.878
that was using the power of the ice stone.

22:59.961 --> 23:01.671
Yes, I've heard of it.

23:01.755 --> 23:04.716
[Sun] However, I was told
that it had become useless

23:04.800 --> 23:06.718
after Gwigu's pottery broke.

23:06.802 --> 23:07.761
That's why…

23:08.637 --> 23:11.098
I moved the spirit of Gwigu
from the pottery

23:11.181 --> 23:12.849
into the body of a dead dog.

23:14.559 --> 23:16.978
The dog that is on its way in now…

23:17.729 --> 23:18.980
Gwigu is that dog.

23:19.481 --> 23:21.817
[tense music continues]

23:21.900 --> 23:22.943
Gwigu?

23:27.489 --> 23:28.573
[court lady] What should we do now?

23:30.117 --> 23:31.952
How many of our people
are in the palace now?

23:32.536 --> 23:33.703
There are more than ten.

23:34.287 --> 23:35.664
Is there any news from Cheonbugwan?

23:35.747 --> 23:38.625
I sent someone there.
They will be here soon.

23:39.292 --> 23:41.503
[breathes deeply]

24:04.442 --> 24:06.987
This meeting was for Songrim
and the royal family

24:07.070 --> 24:08.822
to finally make peace with one another.

24:09.489 --> 24:12.826
The Crown Prince kindly visited you
and invited you here himself.

24:12.909 --> 24:16.705
But you wish to bring a beast in here
without His Majesty's permission?

24:16.788 --> 24:18.790
I've been granted permission
to bring in the dog.

24:18.874 --> 24:20.667
And Gwigu cannot go wild

24:20.750 --> 24:23.461
or create danger
since it lives inside the body of a dog.

24:23.545 --> 24:26.673
So it cannot harm a soul shifter
even if it sees one?

24:26.756 --> 24:30.260
It will instead let you know by barking.

24:31.553 --> 24:34.222
[imitates barking]

24:34.890 --> 24:36.892
[tense music rises]

24:42.480 --> 24:44.149
[Fluffy growling]

24:44.232 --> 24:45.609
- [barks]
- [women gasp]

24:45.692 --> 24:47.277
[woman 1] Why is a dog here?

24:47.360 --> 24:49.237
- [men gasp]
- [barks]

24:51.323 --> 24:52.616
[growling]

24:52.699 --> 24:53.992
[Jang Uk] A soul shifter.

24:54.868 --> 24:59.039
As we suspected, there are more
soul shifters within the palace.

25:00.332 --> 25:01.666
[barks]

25:02.167 --> 25:03.710
- [gasps]
- [Fluffy barking]

25:04.461 --> 25:05.587
What was that sound?

25:06.338 --> 25:09.549
Does this mean there is a soul shifter
in my palace?

25:09.633 --> 25:10.675
- [Fluffy continue barking]
- [Master Lee] Mm.

25:11.343 --> 25:12.385
It seems that there is.

25:13.094 --> 25:15.597
Then why are you just standing there
like that?

25:15.680 --> 25:18.433
Get out there
and catch the soul shifter right now.

25:18.516 --> 25:21.394
Didn't I tell you before already?
It's a present.

25:21.478 --> 25:24.356
Well then, I'll just leave my gift here
with you and the queen,

25:24.439 --> 25:25.774
so that you may use Gwigu

25:25.857 --> 25:28.360
to catch the soul shifters
by yourself, Your Majesty.

25:29.194 --> 25:30.987
We do not need it, so take it away.

25:31.613 --> 25:34.199
How dare you bring a beast like this
into the palace?

25:34.282 --> 25:38.453
His Majesty already suffers from anxiety.
Are you just trying to bring harm his way?

25:41.248 --> 25:44.876
But, Mother, we were the ones
who invited Master Lee to the palace.

25:44.960 --> 25:46.670
No, it's not your place. Stay out of this.

25:47.545 --> 25:51.132
The mages of Cheonbugwan
are in charge of protecting the palace.

25:51.216 --> 25:52.717
If anything has been made with sorcery,

25:52.801 --> 25:54.386
they will be the only ones
who are responsible

25:54.469 --> 25:55.387
for getting rid of it from here.

25:55.470 --> 25:58.014
A devious beast living inside a dead dog

25:58.098 --> 25:59.891
and the people of Songrim interfering.

26:00.433 --> 26:03.311
It is all but an attempt
to humiliate the royal family.

26:05.355 --> 26:07.232
You must put a stop to this, Your Majesty.

26:22.998 --> 26:25.333
[thrilling music playing]

26:29.129 --> 26:31.506
[barking]

26:35.093 --> 26:37.679
[Jin Mu] The man who should be protecting
the royal family,

26:37.762 --> 26:40.181
has brought a beast to the palace.

26:40.265 --> 26:41.516
[growls]

26:41.599 --> 26:43.685
This beast is Master Lee's gift
for the King.

26:43.768 --> 26:45.312
So move aside now.

26:45.395 --> 26:47.731
I cannot disobey His Majesty.
I must bring him inside.

26:47.814 --> 26:49.399
[snickers]

26:53.361 --> 26:54.362
Really?

26:54.446 --> 26:56.364
Then you should try your best
to get inside.

26:56.948 --> 26:58.825
Go and get rid of that trespassing beast.

26:58.908 --> 27:00.201
[swords clinking]

27:01.202 --> 27:04.289
And if you're able to do that,
I shall give you a reward.

27:04.372 --> 27:07.625
[Jang Uk] Damn it.
Is this why he picked me to do this?

27:07.709 --> 27:08.835
[barking]

27:11.463 --> 27:13.673
[sword clinking]

27:17.677 --> 27:19.220
[celestial music playing]

27:22.849 --> 27:23.808
[mages scream]

27:25.602 --> 27:27.937
[all grunting]

27:29.105 --> 27:30.482
[Jang Uk yelps]

27:36.071 --> 27:37.781
Your Majesty, it is I, Jin Mu.

27:38.281 --> 27:41.368
I shall get rid of these insolent men
from Songrim for you.

27:41.451 --> 27:44.454
His Majesty invited us to the palace
and we're still talking.

27:44.537 --> 27:46.581
And it is not your place
to interfere here, Jin Mu.

27:46.664 --> 27:48.958
How dare you try to bring that dog in
without permission.

27:49.042 --> 27:50.668
What kind of madness
have you brought to us?

27:50.752 --> 27:51.961
That's enough now.

28:08.395 --> 28:10.688
Guards. What are you doing?
You need to stop that man.

28:15.276 --> 28:16.403
[Go Won] Father.

28:16.486 --> 28:18.071
You must stop both of them.

28:18.154 --> 28:20.407
If this leads to a fight, it will surely
end our relationship with Songrim.

28:20.990 --> 28:21.950
[Queen] No. We must fight.

28:22.033 --> 28:24.953
Songrim has brought this beast
into the royal palace.

28:25.036 --> 28:26.621
And Cheonbugwan
is simply protecting our family.

28:27.372 --> 28:29.207
- But, Father.
- Your Majesty.

28:29.290 --> 28:31.418
[tense music continues playing]

28:33.878 --> 28:34.963
I order…

28:37.006 --> 28:38.091
you all to stop.

28:40.260 --> 28:42.095
[grunts]

28:44.639 --> 28:46.599
[swords rasping]

28:55.942 --> 28:57.277
[all grunting]

28:57.360 --> 28:58.653
You must stop!

29:03.283 --> 29:05.493
[panting]

29:13.334 --> 29:14.586
Master Lee.

29:14.669 --> 29:17.464
This was a friendly meeting.
Did you have to shock me like this?

29:18.131 --> 29:19.674
I'm sorry for the shock.

29:20.633 --> 29:24.012
But please, if the ice stone
is revealed to the world,

29:24.095 --> 29:26.556
you will see a far bigger conflict
than this.

29:27.140 --> 29:28.224
The ice stone?

29:28.308 --> 29:29.976
[Go Won]
Is it because of the soul shifters?

29:30.059 --> 29:31.644
People have used what remains

29:31.728 --> 29:34.731
of the Soul Ejector after the Great Chaos
to shift souls from time to time.

29:35.440 --> 29:39.569
Well, someone is. They seem to be
making that Soul Ejector once more.

29:41.321 --> 29:44.699
The ice stone has come out into the world.

29:50.872 --> 29:51.915
[Sun] And so?

29:51.998 --> 29:54.167
Where is the ice stone?
And who has a hold of it?

29:54.834 --> 29:56.711
[Master Lee]
It is probably in the hands of those

29:56.795 --> 30:00.423
who sent the assassin here and turned
a Songrim mage into a soul shifter.

30:00.507 --> 30:02.550
[Jin Mu] I was told that
Master Seo Gyeong destroyed

30:02.634 --> 30:05.929
all the ice stones years ago
after the Great Chaos.

30:06.012 --> 30:09.933
But it appears he left a few in Songrim
instead of getting rid of them all.

30:10.016 --> 30:13.561
How can human desire be eradicated
because one tries to?

30:13.645 --> 30:14.687
Except…

30:16.022 --> 30:17.482
the ice stone's return

30:17.565 --> 30:21.778
also implies the return of a great man
like Master Seo Gyeong to stop it.

30:24.280 --> 30:27.325
I heard Master Seo Gyeong was born
with the energy of the King's Star.

30:27.909 --> 30:30.036
However, Master Seo Gyeong
didn't become the king.

30:31.746 --> 30:33.122
Do you mean it could be

30:33.790 --> 30:36.417
someone else born with the energy
of the King's Star?

30:38.711 --> 30:41.130
[enigmatic music playing]

30:41.214 --> 30:43.633
[Master Lee] Even if one exists,
the light will be faint

30:43.716 --> 30:46.219
and the energy
of the surrounding seven stars

30:46.302 --> 30:48.012
will not have shown themselves either.

30:49.013 --> 30:51.224
A power that defies the laws of nature

30:51.307 --> 30:53.685
and bring chaos to the world
has returned again.

30:53.768 --> 30:55.186
Which means someone just as strong

30:55.270 --> 30:57.146
should appear to stop it.

30:58.231 --> 30:59.315
That way…

31:00.608 --> 31:03.653
the world will be able to maintain
its balance without complete destruction.

31:04.654 --> 31:05.780
[sighs]

31:09.659 --> 31:14.414
What I mean is, there's simply no need
for Your Majesty to feel so anxious.

31:15.874 --> 31:19.878
Do my words help you calm your anxiety
about the matter?

31:19.961 --> 31:21.421
[whimpers]

31:24.841 --> 31:27.093
Thank you for your words of comfort.

31:27.927 --> 31:30.346
[Master Lee]
Well then, I shall take my leave now.

31:31.222 --> 31:33.558
Since you have refused to accept my gift,

31:33.641 --> 31:36.352
I suppose I will take Gwigu back with me.

31:38.062 --> 31:40.064
- Your Majesty.
- Do as you please.

31:59.417 --> 32:01.711
No, wait. Wait, wait, wait, wait, wait.

32:02.378 --> 32:04.213
Are we leaving without bringing him in?

32:04.297 --> 32:05.840
I saw everything I had to see.

32:08.301 --> 32:11.429
Does this mean
there is a soul shifter in my palace?

32:11.512 --> 32:13.139
We do not need it, so take it away.

32:13.222 --> 32:15.725
How dare you bring a beast like this
into the palace?

32:17.185 --> 32:19.646
I could see it clearly in their fear.

32:20.939 --> 32:22.023
[clicking tongue]

32:22.607 --> 32:24.317
[Master Lee] Oh, dear, were you startled?

32:24.400 --> 32:26.486
- Did those bad guys hurt you?
- [Fluffy panting]

32:26.569 --> 32:28.321
- They hurt you?
- [Fluffy whimpers]

32:29.072 --> 32:32.116
The dog did not get hurt.
But thanks to you, I certainly did.

32:33.785 --> 32:34.827
You got hurt?

32:35.495 --> 32:37.997
[Master Lee] Oh, getting hurt
while fighting those goons.

32:38.081 --> 32:39.874
Still has a long way to go, I see.

32:39.958 --> 32:41.542
- [sighs]
- [Master Lee] Wait.

32:42.126 --> 32:44.045
I see blood. Are you hurt?

32:44.879 --> 32:46.047
That is my blood.

32:46.130 --> 32:48.049
He did not… Ugh?

32:48.132 --> 32:50.176
- What? Blood?
- You're bleeding.

32:50.843 --> 32:52.470
Oh, thank goodness, you're okay.

32:53.846 --> 32:55.431
[sighs]

32:55.515 --> 32:56.557
[groans softly]

32:56.641 --> 32:57.642
[Master Lee] Hmm…

32:58.184 --> 32:59.477
Does it hurt?

32:59.560 --> 33:01.187
- [yelping]
- [Master Lee] Huh.

33:01.270 --> 33:02.981
It hurts.
[clicks tongue]

33:03.064 --> 33:05.400
It hurts. Ouch.

33:09.195 --> 33:10.571
[whimpers]

33:10.655 --> 33:12.865
- [barks]
- [pants, breathing heavily]

33:14.951 --> 33:16.953
[Seo Yul]
That Gwigu belongs to Master Lee.

33:17.620 --> 33:20.289
And how much does he actually know
about Mu-deok?

33:21.541 --> 33:23.501
And what will Uk do if he finds out…

33:23.584 --> 33:25.211
- [Jang Uk groans]
- …about Naksu?

33:34.012 --> 33:35.096
[Seo Yul] Are you all right?

33:36.597 --> 33:37.724
You are hurt all over.

33:37.807 --> 33:39.559
I will be fine, all right?

33:39.642 --> 33:42.353
Did you find any soul shifters?
What about the ice stone?

33:42.437 --> 33:44.981
- [Seo Yul sighs]
- [Dang-gu] You have no idea.

33:45.773 --> 33:48.026
It was all just chaos over there.

33:48.609 --> 33:51.112
So you caused a scene
but failed to find anyone?

33:51.195 --> 33:54.365
If you brought the dog all the way here,
you should at least let it bite someone.

33:55.241 --> 33:56.325
[Seo Yul] Uk.

33:56.409 --> 33:58.578
Finding a soul shifter in the royal palace

33:58.661 --> 34:00.997
is different from finding one
in Songrim or Cheonbugwan.

34:02.206 --> 34:03.708
If things escalate,

34:03.791 --> 34:06.294
it will mean the royal family
and Songrim will fight.

34:07.837 --> 34:08.796
[sighs]

34:09.422 --> 34:10.381
[Dang-gu] Let's go now.

34:10.465 --> 34:11.799
You should get treated at least.

34:12.508 --> 34:13.509
[Eunuch Oh] Master Lee.

34:14.552 --> 34:15.845
[Eunuch Oh panting]

34:17.055 --> 34:19.057
Please wait here just for a moment.

34:19.140 --> 34:22.226
The Crown Prince has asked me
to escort you to his palace.

34:22.810 --> 34:25.104
- The Crown Prince did?
- It looks like it will rain soon,

34:25.188 --> 34:27.565
and until the rain stops,
he has asked you to stay.

34:29.817 --> 34:30.902
Let us go.

34:38.868 --> 34:40.119
Let's go. You should…

34:40.203 --> 34:42.371
- [Jang Uk] Right.
- [Dang-gu] …get him back safely…

34:42.455 --> 34:43.831
- Huh?
- …uh, to Songrim.

34:45.249 --> 34:46.209
Hey, come here.

34:47.835 --> 34:48.836
Come here.

34:49.879 --> 34:51.881
[ominous music playing]

34:59.597 --> 35:00.973
[gasps]

35:01.057 --> 35:03.226
You should have let me know
before the people of Songrim

35:03.309 --> 35:06.229
- made their way into the palace.
- I thought it was…

35:06.813 --> 35:08.940
was just going to be a simple meeting.

35:09.023 --> 35:12.401
If the Queen is put in danger, that means
you will meet the same fate as Eunuch Kim

35:12.485 --> 35:14.612
and become petrified,
you useless imbecile!

35:16.739 --> 35:18.950
- [sighs]
- [court lady panting]

35:26.582 --> 35:30.586
A new King's Star who could be
the next Master Seo Gyeong?

35:30.670 --> 35:31.921
[snickers]

35:33.256 --> 35:35.967
The King's Star being created
through sorcery,

35:36.801 --> 35:38.803
would spell the end of Songrim.

35:42.682 --> 35:46.018
Do not worry,
I have sent back Gwigu to Songrim first.

35:47.061 --> 35:49.105
I apologize for startling you.

35:49.188 --> 35:51.440
When a soul shifter was found in Songrim,

35:51.524 --> 35:53.901
I have been on the lookout for one
in the palace as well.

35:54.944 --> 35:58.156
A soul shifter tried to enter
the royal palace the last time too.

35:58.906 --> 36:01.033
I had heard that the person who shifted
in that man's soul

36:01.117 --> 36:02.869
and then killed him was Naksu.

36:04.078 --> 36:06.706
[eerie music playing]

36:07.290 --> 36:08.374
Naksu?

36:10.251 --> 36:13.087
The female assassin
who killed many skilled fighters.

36:13.754 --> 36:15.590
Heads fell to the ground
wherever she went,

36:15.673 --> 36:17.550
which is why she was called Naksu.

36:17.633 --> 36:19.719
There is a rumor that she shifted souls

36:19.802 --> 36:22.013
and they say
that she is still alive today.

36:22.096 --> 36:24.348
[tense music playing]

36:24.432 --> 36:26.058
A soul-shifting Naksu?

36:27.643 --> 36:29.395
What an interesting rumor.

36:37.737 --> 36:39.155
[rain pattering]

36:43.576 --> 36:45.578
[ominous music playing]

36:51.918 --> 36:53.085
[grunts]

37:03.638 --> 37:07.516
I hope Mu-deok gets caught
before Young Master Jang returns.

37:09.894 --> 37:11.395
- [thunder rumbles]
- Oh! Oh, my.

37:12.688 --> 37:13.689
[maid Kim gasps]

37:14.523 --> 37:16.192
[stuttering]
Mu-deok…

37:18.486 --> 37:19.862
Why are you shaking?

37:20.488 --> 37:22.823
Do you really believe
that I actually killed someone?

37:24.617 --> 37:26.661
You, come inside now.

37:32.250 --> 37:33.584
Why did you come here?

37:34.669 --> 37:36.003
To pack up your things and run?

37:36.087 --> 37:38.130
I came here so I could ask you
for a favor.

37:38.714 --> 37:40.925
The leader of Songrim asked me
to bring you in if I saw you.

37:41.926 --> 37:43.094
Mu-deok.

37:43.177 --> 37:44.470
It was not you, right?

37:45.179 --> 37:47.014
- It wasn't me.
- Then why did you run away

37:47.098 --> 37:48.307
from the leader of Songrim?

37:48.391 --> 37:50.101
[sighs]
The situation forced me to.

37:51.477 --> 37:52.770
Mu-deok,

37:53.521 --> 37:54.605
is…

37:55.523 --> 37:57.400
there a big secret you're hiding from me?

38:02.905 --> 38:04.115
What you're hiding…

38:05.324 --> 38:07.034
does the Young Master Jang know about it?

38:10.121 --> 38:11.247
[gasps]

38:13.040 --> 38:16.627
Mu-deok, I want you to run away from here.

38:17.211 --> 38:19.964
I will give you enough money.
So just run as far as you can

38:20.047 --> 38:21.173
- and never come back.
- I cannot.

38:22.383 --> 38:24.719
I cannot leave Young Master Jang
no matter what happens.

38:24.802 --> 38:25.928
Why is that?

38:27.305 --> 38:30.433
Our Young Master Jang will only be
suspected if you stay with him.

38:30.516 --> 38:31.851
If you're really worried about him,

38:32.643 --> 38:34.103
then I need you to help me.

38:34.186 --> 38:35.938
You said you cannot tell
the leader of Songrim.

38:36.022 --> 38:37.106
And you will not get out of here.

38:37.690 --> 38:38.858
What do you plan to do?

38:40.693 --> 38:42.528
I have to find the real assassin.

38:43.988 --> 38:48.367
That assassin is going around
and killing everyone who knows them.

38:48.451 --> 38:49.869
[thunder rumbles]

38:53.414 --> 38:55.333
[So-i] Cheonbugwan's Gwanju lives here?

38:56.292 --> 38:58.169
It must be a very prestigious family.

38:59.962 --> 39:03.758
Is there someone from the Jang family
who has also seen your face?

39:06.135 --> 39:09.055
Just go wait over there
and I'll bring that person to you.

39:19.732 --> 39:22.318
[Mu-deok] First, I am going
to see someone that can testify

39:22.401 --> 39:24.236
that I wasn't in that room at that inn

39:24.320 --> 39:25.988
when all of those people there
were killed.

39:27.365 --> 39:28.657
And who is that?

39:29.241 --> 39:30.618
It is Young Lady Jinyowon.

39:31.619 --> 39:33.204
I ran into her when I was at the inn.

39:34.205 --> 39:36.999
Do you think that mean young lady
will agree to see you?

39:37.625 --> 39:38.751
Maidservant Kim.

39:39.960 --> 39:42.213
Please I need you to take me
into Jinyowon.

39:44.423 --> 39:45.424
Jinyowon?

39:51.222 --> 39:53.224
[thunder rumbles]

40:07.113 --> 40:08.614
- [So-i gasps]
- [cane thuds]

40:09.281 --> 40:13.452
Oh, I'm very sorry. Could I ask you
to pick up my cane for me?

40:19.917 --> 40:20.876
Thank you so much.

40:21.752 --> 40:24.296
Could you tell me where it is
that I am right now?

40:25.047 --> 40:29.009
Oh, this is the house of Master Jang Gang,
Cheonbugwan's Gwanju.

40:29.885 --> 40:31.929
Oh. I understand.

40:33.013 --> 40:34.098
Thank you so much.

40:47.361 --> 40:48.612
Mu-deok.

40:48.696 --> 40:49.738
Let's go.

40:57.288 --> 40:59.498
[So-i]
Looks like Mu-deok really can see now.

41:00.124 --> 41:02.084
But she didn't recognize me at all.

41:02.877 --> 41:04.545
I wonder if that's a good thing.

41:08.174 --> 41:09.216
Why are you alone?

41:10.217 --> 41:13.137
I was mistaken.
It turns out I did not know her.

41:14.555 --> 41:16.974
So let us return to Cheonbugwan.
We are done now.

41:29.153 --> 41:31.655
- [boy 1] Can I try it as well?
- [girl] No.

41:31.739 --> 41:33.866
Come on. Stop it.

41:33.949 --> 41:35.868
I'm getting all wet.

41:35.951 --> 41:37.578
It is that umbrella.

41:37.661 --> 41:39.121
[Seo Yul] It's an umbrella.

41:40.080 --> 41:41.957
You can take this instead.

41:45.336 --> 41:48.506
Stop it. My mom is gonna scold me.
Stop it already.

41:49.173 --> 41:52.218
- [giggles] Who cares if you get wet?
- Hey.

41:52.718 --> 41:55.721
Would you trade umbrellas with me?

41:59.600 --> 42:03.896
Well, I heard that Naksu shifted her soul

42:03.979 --> 42:07.733
into the body of a very tall
and a very burly young man.

42:07.816 --> 42:11.320
She could have also shifted her soul
into the body of a short, petite woman.

42:13.405 --> 42:15.783
If she entered into such a weak body,

42:15.866 --> 42:18.035
there would be no need to try
to get rid of her.

42:19.495 --> 42:20.829
[Dang-gu] Hmm…

42:20.913 --> 42:22.039
no, I tell you.

42:22.581 --> 42:24.792
They said Naksu in Blue was a man.
They were sure of it.

42:25.584 --> 42:27.002
[Go Won] "Naksu in Blue."

42:27.086 --> 42:28.671
I've heard that nickname before.

42:28.754 --> 42:30.464
[Dang-gu]
He covered himself with a blue cloth.

42:30.548 --> 42:32.258
So, for a while, it became such a trend

42:32.341 --> 42:34.635
that everyone was choosing to wear
a blue cloth.

42:34.718 --> 42:37.096
People wore the blue cloth because

42:37.179 --> 42:40.224
they thought Naksu in Blue would protect
them all from the alchemy of souls.

42:41.934 --> 42:43.936
Though Naksu was a deadly assassin,

42:45.229 --> 42:48.816
she never hurt ordinary people
and was incredibly strong too.

42:53.195 --> 42:56.657
[sighs]
Some people could be very foolish.

42:56.740 --> 42:58.325
It is not that they are foolish.

42:59.201 --> 43:00.452
They are just frightened.

43:03.205 --> 43:05.833
Because people know those murders
were really committed

43:06.667 --> 43:09.461
by those with power and authority
who still remain today.

43:11.255 --> 43:12.715
Condemning such fear

43:13.674 --> 43:15.843
as foolishness is simply negligence.

43:25.102 --> 43:27.021
That is why I gathered this meeting,

43:27.104 --> 43:28.731
hoping to think of a solution
for all of us.

43:28.814 --> 43:32.026
So you ignoring that and criticizing me
is the real arrogance.

43:35.279 --> 43:39.992
Uh, well, while caught between
that negligence and arrogance,

43:40.075 --> 43:42.578
I just wish for some concordance.

43:43.162 --> 43:45.414
Master Lee is also here with us.

43:45.497 --> 43:46.665
[Dang-gu] So let us drink our tea.

43:47.499 --> 43:48.584
[Go Won clears throat]

43:49.752 --> 43:51.045
[Eunuch Oh] Your Royal Highness.

43:52.046 --> 43:52.880
What now?

43:56.800 --> 43:59.553
Young Lady Heo from the infirmary
wishes to speak.

43:59.637 --> 44:00.638
Let her in.

44:09.146 --> 44:10.439
What brings you here?

44:10.522 --> 44:13.484
I heard someone got into a fight
and is injured.

44:13.567 --> 44:15.194
I came so I could take a look.

44:17.321 --> 44:19.615
[Go Won] There is only one person here
with injuries.

44:19.698 --> 44:22.576
- Take him and treat his wounds.
- No, I'm all right.

44:22.660 --> 44:24.161
It won't take too long.

44:24.244 --> 44:25.371
Please come with me.

44:27.790 --> 44:28.832
[Go Won chuckles softly]

44:37.591 --> 44:40.511
We will soon be hearing news
of Uk's engagement again.

44:40.594 --> 44:41.637
How many now?

44:41.720 --> 44:43.722
- What are you talking about?
- [Go Won] You didn't know?

44:43.806 --> 44:46.016
Looks don't lie.
You really don't know anything.

44:46.100 --> 44:48.102
Rumor has already spread.

44:48.185 --> 44:51.897
You three are the top candidates
to be Heo Yeom's grandson-in-law.

44:51.980 --> 44:54.149
The third on her grandfather's list

44:54.233 --> 44:56.068
appears to be the first on her list.

44:57.027 --> 44:58.987
Heo Yeom said it would happen
within the year.

44:59.071 --> 45:01.782
Talks of engagement are coming.
I guarantee that.

45:07.871 --> 45:11.792
The wounds are not too deep, so you can
just take this pill to stop the bleeding.

45:11.875 --> 45:14.711
Why go through this trouble
when I could have gotten it earlier?

45:14.795 --> 45:16.630
Well, I heard you have been hurt earlier.

45:16.713 --> 45:21.093
So I thought that I could feel at ease
if I saw your injuries for myself.

45:24.054 --> 45:24.930
Well…

45:25.556 --> 45:29.893
you already got hurt from your many duels,
and I… I was a little concerned.

45:31.019 --> 45:32.271
Thanks, but I am fine.

45:32.980 --> 45:34.022
Yes.

45:37.568 --> 45:39.278
[gentle music playing]

45:39.361 --> 45:44.533
Oh, right. You know, Maidservant Kim
gave this to me as a gift earlier.

45:44.616 --> 45:47.244
I have not had the chance
to thank her yet.

45:49.037 --> 45:50.330
It looks the same.

45:55.627 --> 45:56.628
What do you mean?

45:58.630 --> 46:01.550
It's the exact same
as the one I've seen for 20 years.

46:01.633 --> 46:03.635
Is this valuable to you?

46:03.719 --> 46:04.970
[sighs]

46:05.846 --> 46:06.930
[Yun-ok gasps]

46:07.014 --> 46:09.808
[Jang Uk] Hmm. It looks new,

46:09.892 --> 46:11.894
so it does not seem like
she gifted you ours.

46:12.686 --> 46:14.521
Wow, they made it look so similar.

46:15.856 --> 46:16.690
[Dang-gu] Wow.

46:17.357 --> 46:19.318
The Crown Prince might actually be right.

46:20.444 --> 46:22.613
Uk really might be getting engaged soon.

46:22.696 --> 46:24.656
But to Master Heo, he's third in line.

46:26.992 --> 46:29.328
Hey, first place. Will you marry her?

46:30.370 --> 46:33.415
If you get married, you'll return
to Seoho Fortress, won't you?

46:33.999 --> 46:37.461
[in baby voice] Oh, Yul, I'll be lonely.
Don't get married. Hmm?

46:38.629 --> 46:42.216
[Master Lee]
I can recognize any soul shifter.

46:49.515 --> 46:52.059
It would be best to take her
to Seoho Fortress soon.

46:52.142 --> 46:53.060
Take who?

46:54.061 --> 46:54.937
Me?

46:55.896 --> 46:57.397
[quirky music playing]

46:59.191 --> 47:00.317
[yelps]

47:01.109 --> 47:02.444
[groans]
I take that back.

47:03.153 --> 47:07.741
After having seen how you reacted today,
I feel very much at ease.

47:08.325 --> 47:09.952
I'm relieved to hear you say that.

47:10.869 --> 47:12.913
What is that that you wish
to ask of me in private?

47:12.996 --> 47:14.248
[inhales deeply]

47:15.082 --> 47:17.668
Would you be willing to give to me

47:17.751 --> 47:19.753
Naksu's sword that you possess?

47:19.836 --> 47:21.838
[ominous music playing]

47:28.428 --> 47:31.515
I did go last year to see the magic show.

47:32.224 --> 47:33.475
I saw elephants.

47:33.976 --> 47:37.187
But I'll act like it's my first time
when I go with Dang-gu.

47:37.271 --> 47:39.815
So you are going to see it
with Young Master Park, huh?

47:39.898 --> 47:42.067
Y-You startled me. Why did you come here?

47:42.150 --> 47:44.695
I have come to ask for a favor from you.

47:44.778 --> 47:45.904
Favor?

47:46.947 --> 47:48.323
Don't bother.

47:48.407 --> 47:51.493
No matter what,
I've no intention of helping you out.

47:51.577 --> 47:53.203
I am being framed for murder.

47:53.954 --> 47:55.080
What?

47:55.163 --> 47:57.457
Can you please go
and talk to the leader of Songrim

47:58.125 --> 48:00.544
and tell him that you saw me earlier
when we were at the inn?

48:01.670 --> 48:05.924
You want me to tell him with my own mouth
that I was there with you?

48:06.008 --> 48:07.801
And to go all the way to Songrim?

48:07.884 --> 48:09.970
[scoffs]
Have you gone mad?

48:11.513 --> 48:13.807
[whimpers softly]
I beg of you to help.

48:14.474 --> 48:16.351
I have no one else to turn to.

48:17.811 --> 48:18.770
[clears throat]

48:19.438 --> 48:20.606
I won't.

48:20.689 --> 48:22.274
I told him I had an extra ticket.

48:22.357 --> 48:24.568
He can't know
I bought them from a scalper.

48:24.651 --> 48:27.279
Your embarrassment may only last a moment,

48:27.362 --> 48:29.364
but I could really die because of this.

48:29.448 --> 48:32.409
Hmm. And if my mother hears,
I'll die as well.

48:32.492 --> 48:35.245
It's not like
she would really kill her own daughter.

48:35.329 --> 48:37.539
I thought you came for a favor.
Why are you angry?

48:37.623 --> 48:38.749
[sighs]

48:40.292 --> 48:43.587
Then, I suppose I may have
to explain this to your mother

48:44.087 --> 48:45.714
and ask her to help me instead.

48:45.797 --> 48:47.424
You'll tell my mother?

48:48.133 --> 48:50.385
Oh. Look, there she is now.

48:52.763 --> 48:55.891
You didn't need to bring gifts
to apologize for the past.

48:55.974 --> 48:57.017
[maid Kim chuckles softly]

48:57.100 --> 49:00.604
The more I thought about it,
the more apologetic I felt to the family.

49:02.189 --> 49:04.733
I will just go down there
and ask her myself. All right?

49:04.816 --> 49:05.734
Wait.

49:05.817 --> 49:08.779
I will think about the favor.
Come with me now.

49:17.746 --> 49:19.790
I will be right back.
So just stay right here.

49:20.374 --> 49:21.833
I'll yell if you're not.

49:21.917 --> 49:23.418
- I will come back.
- [Ho-gyeong] Cho-yeon.

49:24.211 --> 49:25.337
Yes, Mother.

49:26.129 --> 49:26.963
Wait here.

49:35.263 --> 49:36.390
[sighs]

49:44.106 --> 49:46.108
[pensive music]

49:58.286 --> 49:59.663
[Mu-deok] It is a young girl.

50:00.997 --> 50:02.165
Who is that?

50:31.611 --> 50:32.988
Is it the incense?

50:37.242 --> 50:38.744
What a lovely vase.

50:39.578 --> 50:43.540
It is a precious vase that will make
the flowers in it emit a stronger scent.

50:44.791 --> 50:46.960
- Is that true?
- Yes.

50:47.043 --> 50:50.005
I have wanted to change the vase
in my daughter's room.

50:51.047 --> 50:51.965
This is perfect.

50:55.677 --> 50:58.722
Uh, Mother, are you putting that
in Bu-yeon's room?

50:58.805 --> 51:00.724
It will make the flowers smell stronger.

51:00.807 --> 51:04.478
And your sister cannot see.
She should at least enjoy the scent.

51:05.645 --> 51:06.563
[Cho-yeon] Hmm.

51:21.036 --> 51:22.370
[Ho-gyeong gasps softly]

51:42.849 --> 51:44.142
[gasps]

51:46.978 --> 51:48.230
- [grunts]
- [both gasp]

51:48.772 --> 51:50.106
[Ho-gyeong] How dare you touch that!

51:50.190 --> 51:52.025
What in the world are you doing
in my daughter's room?

51:56.822 --> 51:58.323
[maid Kim] She came with me.

51:58.406 --> 51:59.866
She must have gotten lost somehow.

52:00.450 --> 52:02.702
Mu-deok, why are you in here?

52:04.996 --> 52:06.164
I'm very sorry.

52:07.958 --> 52:10.126
[Cho-yeon mouthing]

52:11.461 --> 52:13.046
[Ho-gyeong] Please leave right now.

52:13.129 --> 52:14.965
You are not allowed inside this room.

52:15.048 --> 52:16.758
Yes. Let's leave.

52:20.345 --> 52:22.180
[whispers]
I will go later. Shh.

52:23.640 --> 52:24.558
[Mu-deok sighs]

52:24.641 --> 52:25.725
Cho-yeon.

52:26.393 --> 52:29.980
Go tell the servants
to clean Bu-yeon's room again.

52:30.730 --> 52:32.566
Yes. Yes, Mother.

52:40.156 --> 52:42.534
[melancholy music playing]

53:00.260 --> 53:01.261
[Jin Mu] So-i.

53:02.262 --> 53:03.930
This man is to be your father.

53:05.015 --> 53:06.141
My father?

53:07.058 --> 53:09.352
This man is willing to take in
a fake daughter?

53:12.856 --> 53:16.651
Jin Bu-yeon was not born
between me and Jin Ho-gyeong.

53:17.986 --> 53:21.531
The biological father is someone else.

53:30.290 --> 53:32.542
[suspenseful music playing]

53:33.627 --> 53:36.379
To become the daughter of the Jin family,

53:36.463 --> 53:38.340
you must open the door to Jinyowon.

53:38.423 --> 53:42.177
And to do that, the blood
of the Jin family must flow in you.

53:45.722 --> 53:47.057
What are you holding?

53:47.140 --> 53:50.393
This worm has sucked the blood
of a female member of the Jin family.

53:59.611 --> 54:01.404
[So-i gasps, breathes shakily]

54:01.488 --> 54:03.615
[ominous music playing]

54:07.702 --> 54:08.745
[groans]

54:12.457 --> 54:14.584
That is the blood of Cho-yeon in there,

54:15.377 --> 54:16.920
my beloved daughter.

54:18.797 --> 54:20.966
What do you plan on doing with that worm?

54:21.049 --> 54:22.342
Just give me your hand.

54:24.636 --> 54:26.221
I said give me your hand.

54:27.138 --> 54:28.223
[So-i gasps]

54:46.866 --> 54:47.993
[gasps]

54:48.952 --> 54:49.953
[So-i gasping]

54:57.794 --> 54:59.754
[yelping]

55:05.969 --> 55:08.263
[screaming]

55:09.681 --> 55:13.101
[Jin Mu] You now have the blood
of the Jin family running in your veins.

55:13.935 --> 55:16.354
If I do not use sorcery to keep it alive,

55:16.438 --> 55:19.315
that worm will start eating you
from the inside.

55:20.650 --> 55:22.110
So think twice,

55:23.069 --> 55:25.238
if you ever try running from me.

55:32.454 --> 55:35.123
That room belonged to her daughter
who died ten years ago.

55:36.291 --> 55:37.876
Her daughter apparently drowned,

55:38.626 --> 55:41.171
but that woman is still waiting for her
to come back one day.

55:42.756 --> 55:43.965
Forgive the slap,

55:44.924 --> 55:46.551
because she is a pitiful woman.

55:49.721 --> 55:52.766
By chance, was that woman's daughter
blind too?

55:53.683 --> 55:55.977
Mm-hmm. Yeah, she was.

55:57.270 --> 55:59.773
[Mu-deok] The owner of this body
used to be blind as well.

56:00.273 --> 56:03.359
Is that why I suddenly felt
that energy earlier?

56:20.085 --> 56:23.213
[Dang-gu] Master Lee wanted to ask
the Crown Prince something in private.

56:23.838 --> 56:24.839
I see.

56:30.011 --> 56:32.972
The leader has asked us
to escort you to Songrim immediately.

56:33.556 --> 56:35.558
Just me? Why?

56:35.642 --> 56:36.643
[mage 1] Come with us.

56:36.726 --> 56:38.853
[foreboding music playing]

56:47.153 --> 56:48.738
Am I getting locked in here again?

56:49.239 --> 56:51.074
- I mean, what's going on here?
- [mage 1] That is--

56:51.783 --> 56:53.118
The leader told us not to say anything.

56:53.910 --> 56:55.120
[mage 2] Wait here until he comes.

57:04.838 --> 57:08.091
[maid Kim] Mu-deok was seen at the murder,
so I understand why they took her.

57:08.174 --> 57:10.677
But why Young Master Jang
who was at the palace the whole time?

57:12.053 --> 57:14.597
What did the leader of Songrim say?

57:14.681 --> 57:15.682
I'm not sure, either.

57:16.349 --> 57:17.725
[sighs]

57:18.309 --> 57:19.352
Yul.

57:19.435 --> 57:21.563
There's no way in the world
Mu-deok killed somebody.

57:22.188 --> 57:23.481
[Dang-gu] Right?

57:26.359 --> 57:28.570
May I please take a look at the bodies
as well?

57:41.416 --> 57:43.293
[Sang-ho]
It was done by a skilled swordsman.

57:43.918 --> 57:45.670
This certainly
could not have been Mu-deok.

57:47.088 --> 57:48.756
[Seo Yul] She is Naksu, the assassin.

57:49.716 --> 57:51.468
She could have killed those men.

57:56.431 --> 57:58.475
[thug]
I have a good reason for doing this,

57:59.642 --> 58:00.768
so just be on your way.

58:04.647 --> 58:07.484
- I remember them.
- Do you know these men?

58:09.777 --> 58:12.030
A few days ago,
I got into a fight with these people.

58:12.864 --> 58:14.073
[door opens]

58:17.285 --> 58:19.829
[Ju-wol] Can I take their bodies now
for their funeral?

58:26.377 --> 58:28.505
[Sang-ho]
Why is the owner of Chwiseonru here?

58:28.588 --> 58:29.631
Has someone died?

58:30.173 --> 58:32.634
Well, yes, our guards
have just been found dead.

58:39.974 --> 58:41.309
[owl hoots]

58:45.939 --> 58:47.315
Young Master Park.

58:47.398 --> 58:49.317
I just heard from Maidservant Kim.

58:51.236 --> 58:52.362
Young Lady Jin.

58:53.613 --> 58:55.240
I beg you to help Mu-deok, please.

58:57.909 --> 58:59.035
[sighs]

59:03.122 --> 59:06.125
[Cho-yeon] I went to the inn
to buy tickets from scalpers.

59:07.710 --> 59:09.671
And I saw Mu-deok when I was there.

59:10.421 --> 59:12.715
Ugh. Of course,

59:12.799 --> 59:16.594
it was my first time
going to such a place.

59:17.178 --> 59:18.263
I know that.

59:19.097 --> 59:22.850
We talked for a bit,
and right after Mu-deok went inside,

59:22.934 --> 59:24.894
I saw you coming into the inn as well,
my lord.

59:25.728 --> 59:30.275
Of course, I never imagined that you would
frequent a place like that either.

59:30.358 --> 59:31.442
[Dang-gu chuckles nervously]

59:31.943 --> 59:33.111
I know that.

59:36.573 --> 59:37.991
I am certain that…

59:39.033 --> 59:43.121
there wasn't enough time for Mu-deok
to have killed all of those men.

59:44.163 --> 59:47.375
They say a girl posing as a mage
came looking for Mu-deok

59:47.458 --> 59:48.918
not very long ago.

59:49.002 --> 59:52.463
The owner of Chwiseonru
thinks there might be a chance that So-i,

59:52.547 --> 59:54.549
the girl that the broker had warned about.

59:54.632 --> 59:57.010
I once saw a girl
who was arguing with the dead thugs.

59:58.344 --> 59:59.596
The thugs,

59:59.679 --> 01:00:00.972
the broker and the guards.

01:00:01.848 --> 01:00:04.100
They all had something to do
with that girl, So-i.

01:00:04.183 --> 01:00:06.060
Yes, So-i seems very suspicious.

01:00:06.894 --> 01:00:09.147
In any case, it was not Mu-deok.

01:00:10.690 --> 01:00:11.733
Very well.

01:00:12.734 --> 01:00:17.322
I also didn't think that Mu-deok
could have committed murder either.

01:00:17.405 --> 01:00:20.116
I knew it. You knew that Mu-deok
is not somebody

01:00:20.199 --> 01:00:21.534
who would do something like this,
didn't you?

01:00:21.618 --> 01:00:25.163
Then could you please release
Uk and Mu-deok as soon as possible?

01:00:25.246 --> 01:00:27.540
The reason why I locked up those two

01:00:28.374 --> 01:00:30.335
was so I can ask them something else.

01:00:31.377 --> 01:00:32.879
I will take care of it from here.

01:00:32.962 --> 01:00:34.088
You may all leave.

01:00:34.172 --> 01:00:35.340
Yeah.

01:00:50.855 --> 01:00:52.023
[sighs]

01:00:53.024 --> 01:00:54.192
[footsteps approaching]

01:00:54.275 --> 01:00:55.526
My lord.

01:00:56.277 --> 01:00:58.237
At least tell me what is going on here.

01:00:59.697 --> 01:01:02.158
Mu-deok committed murder.

01:01:05.286 --> 01:01:06.287
Huh? What?

01:01:06.371 --> 01:01:09.457
She did that to silence all those people
who knew details about her past.

01:01:10.249 --> 01:01:11.376
[sighs]

01:01:12.627 --> 01:01:16.339
Tell me, what it is that you and Mu-deok
are hiding from me.

01:01:17.840 --> 01:01:20.218
If your statement
does not match Mu-deok's,

01:01:20.885 --> 01:01:23.179
you cannot leave this Secret Room.

01:01:24.055 --> 01:01:25.807
And that child will die.

01:01:32.021 --> 01:01:32.980
[gasps softly]

01:01:47.120 --> 01:01:48.663
[stutters]
Oh, my lord, I am--

01:01:48.746 --> 01:01:50.081
I'm not asking about the killings.

01:01:52.041 --> 01:01:53.668
Uk has told me everything…

01:01:55.294 --> 01:01:56.546
about your secret.

01:02:00.133 --> 01:02:04.053
If you confess and tell me the truth,
I'll spare your life.

01:02:05.179 --> 01:02:06.347
However,

01:02:06.431 --> 01:02:09.308
if anything that you say
differs from what he has said,

01:02:11.436 --> 01:02:12.895
you will have to die.

01:02:13.479 --> 01:02:15.481
[suspenseful music intensifies]

01:02:21.821 --> 01:02:23.698
[Jang Uk]
If he found out she was a soul shifter,

01:02:23.781 --> 01:02:25.742
he would not waste time like this.

01:02:25.825 --> 01:02:29.162
[Mu-deok] He's interrogating us
separately, trying to test us.

01:02:29.245 --> 01:02:31.372
[Jang Uk] We have to say the same thing.

01:02:33.166 --> 01:02:36.627
[Mu-deok] What could Uk have said
to answer the same question?

01:02:36.711 --> 01:02:40.548
[Jang Uk] A secret which ensures
that we say the same thing.

01:02:40.631 --> 01:02:45.636
[Mu-deok] A secret that is private
but will not get me killed if revealed.

01:02:48.306 --> 01:02:49.766
I will tell you now.

01:02:49.849 --> 01:02:51.225
I will tell you now.

01:02:58.900 --> 01:03:00.359
What has just happened?

01:03:01.360 --> 01:03:05.323
Mu-deok and Uk can both be set free.

01:03:05.823 --> 01:03:08.868
What did they say when questioned?
Did they say the same thing?

01:03:12.079 --> 01:03:15.082
They indeed both said
the exact same thing.

01:03:17.585 --> 01:03:19.504
[thrilling music playing]

01:03:44.570 --> 01:03:47.448
- [Jang Uk] You got out.
- [Mu-deok] You got out too.

01:03:48.032 --> 01:03:50.910
- I'm glad you are safe.
- Yeah, me too.

01:03:50.993 --> 01:03:52.829
We'd be in trouble
if we said different things.

01:03:54.372 --> 01:03:55.873
Well, what did you say?

01:03:55.957 --> 01:03:57.667
The fact that we both got out of there…

01:03:59.043 --> 01:04:01.045
means I said the same thing you did.

01:04:06.217 --> 01:04:09.470
You questioned them separately
to find out what they were hiding.

01:04:09.554 --> 01:04:12.390
It seems you got something
out of them, then. Go on.

01:04:12.473 --> 01:04:14.851
What was their secret? What did they say?

01:04:15.768 --> 01:04:17.186
The two of them…

01:04:18.271 --> 01:04:21.816
told me a secret
that managed to completely shut me up.

01:04:24.694 --> 01:04:27.530
They both showed the exact same thing.

01:04:28.155 --> 01:04:29.156
[scoffs]

01:04:29.240 --> 01:04:30.491
[Jang Uk] I will tell you now.

01:04:31.909 --> 01:04:33.244
This is what I hid.

01:04:34.287 --> 01:04:36.080
I tried not to let it show.

01:04:37.665 --> 01:04:39.458
[dramatic music playing]

01:04:53.723 --> 01:04:55.224
The truth is that I…

01:04:55.725 --> 01:04:58.102
I actually…

01:05:05.067 --> 01:05:06.694
like Mu-deok a lot.

01:05:10.531 --> 01:05:12.366
…like my Young Master a lot.

01:05:18.748 --> 01:05:20.875
[Mu-deok] I felt that was something
we would both say.

01:05:23.044 --> 01:05:25.421
Since it is not enough to get me killed.

01:05:25.504 --> 01:05:26.422
Indeed.

01:05:27.006 --> 01:05:30.092
Songrim's Book of Regulations
does not state anything

01:05:30.176 --> 01:05:31.719
about punishing people
for falling in love.

01:05:34.889 --> 01:05:35.723
Correct.

01:05:35.806 --> 01:05:39.852
They simply could not kill a servant
for loving her owner to death.

01:05:41.938 --> 01:05:45.232
You said… you really said
you loved me to death?

01:05:46.984 --> 01:05:48.110
Well…

01:05:48.819 --> 01:05:52.031
I just exaggerated
because I had to convince him.

01:05:52.114 --> 01:05:53.950
[gentle music playing]

01:05:55.284 --> 01:05:56.661
There was no other option.

01:05:58.204 --> 01:06:01.707
I guess that you had no other choice
but to confess that you love me to death.

01:06:03.125 --> 01:06:04.835
Truly, I feel so bad now.

01:06:05.336 --> 01:06:07.588
I was not as passionate in my statement.

01:06:08.255 --> 01:06:09.548
I guess I should try harder.

01:06:09.632 --> 01:06:10.800
Just forget it.

01:06:12.593 --> 01:06:16.597
Do not ever put your life in danger
for something as fickle as love.

01:06:17.932 --> 01:06:19.850
If something like this happens again,

01:06:20.601 --> 01:06:22.603
and it's a life or death situation,

01:06:23.980 --> 01:06:24.939
give up love…

01:06:26.524 --> 01:06:27.733
and live.

01:06:30.111 --> 01:06:31.946
Do that if you do not wish to die.

01:06:32.029 --> 01:06:33.906
This is an order from your master.

01:06:39.245 --> 01:06:40.371
Hey, Master.

01:06:41.080 --> 01:06:42.581
If I do not mind dying,

01:06:43.416 --> 01:06:45.835
then can I keep doing
what I have been doing?

01:06:48.295 --> 01:06:50.423
I told you that
I'm willing to risk it all,

01:06:51.382 --> 01:06:53.175
and that the two of us
are in this together.

01:06:54.552 --> 01:06:56.178
I will keep going, even if it kills me.

01:06:56.721 --> 01:06:58.180
And you should do the same as well.

01:06:58.806 --> 01:07:01.350
I think it's better
if you stick to your confession.

01:07:02.727 --> 01:07:04.311
And keep loving me to death.

01:07:07.148 --> 01:07:09.775
["Love Letter (with you)" by BIG Naughty]

01:07:43.809 --> 01:07:49.231
What would you do if Uk falls in love
with the woman he should not be with?

01:07:49.315 --> 01:07:53.277
If I'm to keep on loving you, of course,
I need to be certain that you are mine.

01:07:53.360 --> 01:07:55.237
[Ho-gyeong]
How dare you disgrace Jinyowon?

01:07:55.988 --> 01:07:58.407
[Mu-deok] They're perfect for each other.
Why did they call it off?

01:07:58.491 --> 01:08:00.242
The person I'm looking for is Shaman Choi.

01:08:00.326 --> 01:08:03.162
[Go Won] If Shaman Choi was hunted
by the mages of Cheonbugwan back then,

01:08:03.245 --> 01:08:06.082
are you seeking her because she bears
a grudge against your father?

01:08:06.165 --> 01:08:08.876
If he comes, let me know right away.

01:08:08.959 --> 01:08:10.544
[Seo Yul]
Even though it's dead, it's still Gwigu.

01:08:10.628 --> 01:08:12.505
[Jang Uk]
You are feigning ignorance, right?

01:08:13.172 --> 01:08:15.758
Hey, Yul. It must be tough for you.

01:08:15.841 --> 01:08:18.177
If you must draw that sword
and point it at someone,

01:08:18.260 --> 01:08:20.554
point it at me before anyone else.
